0..72 Comment "//! The checker admits rules that overlap when each critical pair joins."
73..76 Comment "//!"
77..148 Comment "//! Addition has two zero-unit rules. The rules overlap with recursion."
149..152 Comment "//!"
153..197 Comment "//! Each addition pair rewrites to one term."
198..267 Comment "//! Associativity overlaps with itself. Its critical pair also joins."
